    {
      "slug": "drop-sleeve-lounge-g289",
      "term": "Drop sleeve",
      "definition": "A sleeve set without a shaped armhole. The back and front panels are worked to their full length with straight side edges. The sleeve top is seamed directly to the body at the shoulder, creating a relaxed oversize shape. Drop sleeves are the simplest sleeve construction and suit lounge garments well."
    }
